OL,3,ALuke Evans reveals his secret to
OL,4,Asurviving Hollywood
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor Luke Evans said he has survived
OL,7,FHollywood by "watching and listening"
OL,8,Fto actors he admired.
OL,10,FPontypool-born Evans made the
OL,11,Fobservation while discussing his
OL,12,Fsimilarities and "emotional connection"
OL,13,Fto his character in a new ITV drama,
OL,14,FThe Party.
OL,16,FIt will see Evans star as Martin
OL,17,FGilmour, a journalist shaped by his
OL,18,Flifelong friendship with a wealthy and
OL,19,Fcharismatic politician played by
OL,20,FAberystwyth-born Tom Cullen.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
